Subject: [S] Problems with rowsum in S+ 2000
Message-ID: <38A58712.E01CFD59@virginia.edu>

rowsum in S+ 4.5 has 3 arguments.  In S+ 2000 the documentation
lists 3 arguments but in the function definition the reorder argument does
not appear.  In addition, rowsum in S+ 2000 uses what is probably a
much slower in-line method as opposed to the invocation of .C("rowsum")
in S+ 4.5.  I hope that MathSoft will make sure that the most efficient
method is implemented, and reinstate the reorder argument.  Thanks -Frank

