The answers were :

- That's because of the missing 11th column.
solution :
mydataframe[,11:12] <- cbind(rep(NA,dim(mydataframe)[1]),
                             apply(mydataframe[,1:5],1,mean))

- you could try mydataframe[,12]<-rowMeans(mydataframe[,1:5])
you need to have defined a twelve column data frame though if you haven't
than you can put your means in a vector and use cbind(mydataframe,vector)

- mydataframe$means <- apply(mydataframe[c(1,2,3,4,5)],1,mean)

- a <- rowMeans(mydataframe[,1:5])
   b <- cbind(mydataframe,a)

