-------------------ORIGINAL QUESTION:----------------------
I have a dataframe with two columns, being the identificator of a series
of points. Thus, each line represent a pair of point. The pairs have
been selected previously according to some geographic distance
criterion. What I want now is to aggregate the pairs (i.e. the lines)
which share a point in common to come out with groups (clusters) of
points. In the example below, I would like to aggregate the points as
follow: (53,54,55), (149,151,152), (157,159), and so on.

